<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="theme-color" content="#143b2b"><meta name="description" content="Freshly prepared food from Laddu Bhai Food Point, Hyderabad."><title>Laddu Bhai Food Point | Freshly Prepared</title><link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rath0darya/LBFP/main/temp/AppIcon.png"><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/style.css"></head>
<body><header class="header"><a class="brand" href="#"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rath0darya/LBFP/main/temp/AppIcon.png" alt="Laddu Bhai Food Point logo"><span><b>Laddu Bhai</b><small>FOOD POINT · HYDERABAD</small></span></a><nav><a href="#menu">Menu</a><a href="#promise">Our promise</a><a href="#orders">Your orders</a></nav><button class="cart-button" id="cart-open">Cart <span id="cart-count">0</span></button></header>
<main><section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">✳ &nbsp;MADE FRESH, SERVED WITH CARE</p><h1>Good food.<br><em>Good mood.</em></h1><p class="lead">Your neighbourhood food stop for fresh favourites, satisfying meals and food worth sharing.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="#menu">Explore the menu ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="#promise">Our promise →</a></div><div class="hero-meta">✳ Freshly prepared &nbsp;&nbsp; ✳ Party orders welcome</div></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="glow"></div><div class="art-back">FRESH<br><br>DAILY</div><div class="art-front"><div class="plate">✦</div><small>Made to order</small><b>Always satisfying.</b></div><div class="stamp">GOOD<br>FOOD<br>♥</div></div></section>
<section class="trust"><div>✳ <span><b>Freshly prepared</b><small>Made when you order</small></span></div><div>⌂ <span><b>Local favourite</b><small>Serving our community</small></span></div><div>↗ <span><b>Easy ordering</b><small>Simple, clear checkout</small></span></div></section>
<section class="section" id="menu"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT SOUNDS GOOD?</p><h2>Find your <em>favourite.</em></h2><p class="muted">A little something for every craving.</p></div><label class="search">⌕ <input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Search dishes…"></label></div><div class="categories" id="categories"><button class="active" data-cat="All">All items</button><button data-cat="Meals">Meals</button><button data-cat="Snacks">Snacks</button><button data-cat="Rice & Noodles">Rice &amp; Noodles</button><button data-cat="Chicken">Chicken</button></div><p id="menu-status" class="muted" role="status">Loading menu…</p><div id="menu-grid" class="menu-grid"></div></section>
<section class="promise" id="promise"><div class="seal">LB<span>FP</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">A GOOD FOOD PROMISE</p><h2>Made with care.<br><em>Shared with joy.</em></h2><p>At Laddu Bhai Food Point, the best part of food is bringing people together. Explore the menu, build your order and share your details securely at checkout.</p></div><aside><b>✳ Your table, your rules.</b><small>Choose what you love. We’ll keep your order details together.</small></aside></section>
<section class="section orders" id="orders"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR ACCOUNT</p><h2>Order <em>updates.</em></h2><p class="muted">Look up recent orders using the mobile number used at checkout.</p></div><form id="lookup"><label>Mobile number<input id="lookup-phone" type="tel" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" minlength="10" maxlength="16" required placeholder="Enter your mobile number"></label><button class="button primary">Find orders</button><p id="lookup-status" class="muted" role="status"></p><div id="order-results"></div></form></section></main>
<footer><a class="brand" href="#"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rath0darya/LBFP/main/temp/AppIcon.png" alt=""><span><b>Laddu Bhai</b><small>FOOD POINT</small></span></a><span>Freshly prepared food · Hyderabad</span><span>© <span id="year"></span> Laddu Bhai Food Point</span></footer>
<div class="overlay" id="cart-overlay" hidden><aside class="drawer" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="cart-title"><div class="drawer-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR SELECTION</p><h2 id="cart-title">Your cart</h2></div><button class="close" id="cart-close" aria-label="Close cart">×</button></div><div id="cart-items"></div><div class="drawer-bottom"><div class="total"><span>Subtotal</span><b id="cart-total">₹0</b></div><p class="muted">Delivery charges and availability are confirmed by the restaurant.</p><button class="button primary full" id="checkout-open">Continue to checkout</button></div></aside></div>
<div class="overlay" id="checkout-overlay" hidden><section class="drawer checkout" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="checkout-title"><div class="drawer-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">ALMOST THERE</p><h2 id="checkout-title">Checkout</h2></div><button class="close" id="checkout-close" aria-label="Close checkout">×</button></div><form id="checkout-form"><div class="form-grid"><label>Full name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="100" required></label><label>Mobile number<input name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" minlength="10" maxlength="16" required></label><label class="wide">Email (optional)<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="190"></label><label class="wide">Fulfilment<select name="fulfillment"><option>Pickup</option><option>Delivery</option></select></label><label class="wide">Delivery address <small>(required for delivery)</small><textarea name="address" autocomplete="street-address" rows="2" maxlength="500"></textarea></label><div class="wide location-row"><button class="button" type="button" id="capture-location">Use my current location</button><small id="location-status" class="muted">Optional: share GPS location for accurate delivery.</small><input type="hidden" id="customer-latitude" name="customer_latitude"><input type="hidden" id="customer-longitude" name="customer_longitude"></div><label class="wide">Food preferences (optional)<textarea name="preferences" rows="2" maxlength="500" placeholder="Less spicy, no onion, etc."></textarea></label><label class="wide">Payment preference<select name="payment_method"><option>At Restaurant</option><option>Online</option></select></label></div><p id="checkout-status" class="muted" role="status"></p><button class="button primary full" type="submit">Place order →</button><p class="privacy">Your details are sent to the restaurant server and stored in MySQL. Do not enter card details here.</p></form></section></div><div class="toast" id="toast" role="status"></div><script src="assets/app.js" defer></script></body></html>